      <record javaclass="com.wm.util.Values">
        <value name="node_type">record</value>
        <value name="node_subtype">unknown</value>
        <value name="node_comment">
To specify basic and most frequently used line item data

Comments
1. See the Data Element Dictionary for a complete list of IDs.
2. PO101 is the line item identification.
3. PO106 through PO125 provide for ten different product/service IDs per each item. For example: Case, Color, Drawing No., U.P.C. No., ISBN No., Model No., or SKU.

Syntax Notes:
1. C0302 Conditional
2. C0504 Conditional
3. P0607 Paired Multiple
4. P0809 Paired Multiple
5. P1011 Paired Multiple
6. P1213 Paired Multiple
7. P1415 Paired Multiple
8. P1617 Paired Multiple
9. P1819 Paired Multiple
10. P2021 Paired Multiple
11. P2223 Paired Multiple
12. P2425 Paired Multiple
              </value>
        <record name="node_hints" javaclass="com.wm.util.Values">
        </record>
